## Hit targets

Minimum 44×44 CSS px for any touch-reachable element. Use padding or an `::before` overlay to expand the hit target without changing visual size:

```css
.icon-btn {
  position: relative;
}
.icon-btn::before {
  content: "";
  position: absolute;
  inset: -12px;
}
```
